@startuml
title RF61 — Playbook e plano de jogo · Diagrama de sequência
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber
actor "Head coach / manager (usuário autenticado)" as Manager
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
boundary "API" as API
control "UseCase" as UseCase
control "ClubAnalyst" as ClubAnalyst
queue "EventBus" as EventBus
database "MySQL 8" as MySQL
database "Redis 7" as Redis
actor "Franquia adversária (IA)" as ClubeIA
Manager -> Frontend: abre plano de jogo
Frontend -> API: GET /careers/{id}/game-plan/suggestion?fixtureId
API -> UseCase: SuggestGamePlanUseCase
UseCase -> MySQL: plano, playbook, elenco, histórico do adversário
alt não é dono
  API --> Frontend: 403
else senão
  UseCase -> ClubAnalyst: tendências e confrontos-chave
  ClubAnalyst --> UseCase: sugestão
  UseCase --> API: GamePlanSuggestion
  API --> Frontend: 200
end
Manager -> Frontend: ajusta e salva
Frontend -> API: PUT /careers/{id}/game-plan
API -> UseCase: UpdateGamePlanUseCase
UseCase -> Redis: partida LIVE?
alt LIVE ou fora dos limites
  API --> Frontend: 422 MATCH_LIVE / GAME_PLAN_INVALID
else senão
  UseCase -> MySQL: UPDATE game_plan
  UseCase -> EventBus: GamePlanChanged
  API --> Frontend: 200 + avisos de personnel
end
ClubeIA -> ClubAnalyst: plano da IA pelo estilo
note over UseCase: no kickoff MatchSimulator copia GamePlan e Playbook para o snapshot
@enduml
